# Cursor operating protocol

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Before content changes, read `.dentcast/workflows/global/README.md` and all complete active global sections selected by that router for the current edit scope, plus the complete `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md`. They govern conversation, founder messages, capability failures and Git. Legacy files are backup only; do not read them for execution.
Publish-queue requests («صف انتشار») are the exception and go through `dentcast-router.mdc` first: publishing an item from the queue reads only `.dentcast/workflows/queue-route.md`, reporting the queue's status reads only `.dentcast/workflows/publish-queue.md`, preparing one reads only `.dentcast/workflows/publish-queue.md` and the pack it names. Every other new publication follows `.dentcast/workflows/README.md` and all applicable verbatim module rules (complete modules by default, or the verified readpack: `--after-intake` only after locked Phase B, a self-contained pack with `unknown` arguments earlier). Staging receipts never replace scientific execution or founder decisions.

**Interrupted publication** («انتشار ناقص داشتم»), the run state `.dentcast/PUBLISH-HANDOFF.md` and recovery through `.dentcast/workflows/publish-handoff.md`: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`, «Interrupted publication».

Ledger, the save point and the deliveries: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`.
